GET {{baseUrl}}/availability?staffId=2&serviceId=9999&date=2026-11-16
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### B7. Unknown staff member. EXPECT 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/availability?staffId=9999&serviceId=1&date=2026-11-16
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}


