GET {{baseUrl}}/availability?staffId=2&serviceId=1&date=2026-11-16
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceUserToken}}

### E6. No token. EXPECT 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/availability?staffId=2&serviceId=1&date=2026-11-16
